    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nUNITED\nEFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 1966\ndiscover America\nfly\nthe\nfriendly skies\nUnited.",
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nUNITED\nEFFECTIVE MARCH 1, 1966\ndiscover America\nM the\nfriendly skies\nUnited.",
      "VANCOUVER, B.C.\nSEATTLE-TACOMA\nSPOKANE\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nPENDLETON\nBOISE\nMEDFORD\nRENO\nELKO\nSAN FRANCISCO-\nOAKLAND\nMONTEREY\nSALINAS\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMODESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nELY\nLAS VEGAS\nSANTA BARBARA\nHONOLULU\nOS ANGELES-\nSAN DIEGO\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nDISCOVER AMERICA\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nSAGINAW-BAY CITY MIDLAND\nMUSKEGON FLINT\nBOSTON\nHARPFORD-SPRINGFIELD\nMILWAUKEE\nPROVIDENCE\nGRAND RAPIDS\nDETROI\nCEDAR RAPIDE\nDES MOINES\nOMAHA\nCHICAGO\nTOLED\nSOUTH BEND AKRON OI\nT WAYNE PITTSBU\nNEW YORK\nNEWARK\nALLENTOWN-BETHLEHEM-EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA\nMOLINE ROCK ISLAND-DAVENPORT\nDAYTON\nCOLUMBUS\nLINCOLN\nCHARLESTON, W. V\nRICHMOND\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS-HAMPTON-\nWILLIAMSBURG\nNORFOLK-PORTSMOUTH\nKANSAS CIT\nBRISTOL-KINGSPORT-JOHNSON CI\nGREENSBORO HIGH POINT\nVINSTON-SALEM\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nTULSA\nKNOXVILL\nASHEVILLE\nCHATTANOOG\nMEMPHIS\nHUNTSVICLE\nCHARLOTTE\nATLANTA\nBIRMINGHA\nDALLAS\nJACKSONVILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nHOUSTON\nTAMPA-\nST. PETERSBURG-\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nMIAMI-\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nUNITED/BRANIFF INTERCHANGE SERVICE\n..UNITED/CONTINENTAL INTERCHANGE SERVICE\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE TACOMA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nLOS ANGELES\n\u003e BOSTON\nNEW YORK\n• PHILADELPHIA\nWASHING U\n_HONOLULU\nDISCOVER HAWAII!\nEASIER THAN EVER WITH UNITED!\nHawaii! Tropical dreamland of radiant flowers, graceful\npalm trees, warm, sapphire-hued waters. Glorious land of\nhigh volcanic mountains, fields of sugar cane, rows of\nstubby pineapples, wipe-outs, surfies and the hula.\nAnd United can take you there any day you choose.\nLeave in the morning and start your suntan that afternoon\non the beach at Waikiki. Choose from three classes of serv-\nice. And the fare from San Francisco is as low as $100.\nAnd charge your entire trip with United's Personal Travel\nCredit Card.\nCall your Travel Agent or us.\nAloha!\nfly the friendly skies of United"
    ],
